// Application manifest for the CMake (clang-cl) build of the engine.
//
// main.vcxproj does not compile this script: MSBuild generates and embeds the
// same manifest itself (Manifest EnableDpiAwareness=true plus the linker's
// default UAC fragment). The CMake build links with /MANIFEST:NO and embeds
// res/main.manifest from here instead, so the result does not depend on the
// linker's manifest-merging support.
//
// 1 = CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID, 24 = RT_MANIFEST.
1 24 "res/main.manifest"
